                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Unique Sons of Behemat Hero^^** that does not have an artefact of power.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Give that **^^Hero^^** 1 artefact of power from &apos;Titanic Trophies&apos;.
**Designer&apos;s Note:** *This artefact of power is given to the unit during the deployment phase, not during army composition.*</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
                <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </selectionEntry>
